.TH OMACHAT-PROTOCOL 7 "2026-10-28" "OmaChat"
.SH NAME
omachat-protocol \- local IPC and handle-server protocol
.SH DESCRIPTION
Local IPC uses bounded JSON lines over a private same-user Unix socket.
Clients negotiate the version with hello before issuing requests. IPC version 4
does not accept hosted chat commands.
The handle server uses WebSocket, pinned server authentication and device-key
challenges. TLS is required except for numeric-loopback development connections.
The server stores account handles. It does not store chat.
